      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "a2b7d3ec72484d5aa8ed1d772a8511b9_26",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "STA"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "on the other hand prescribes that such repeal shall not affect any right, privilege application or liability acquired, accrued or incurred under any of the enactment or orders under repeal."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "7d2fe8fa00384fe99381da35d676a5f6_27",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "11. That being the position, generally the repeal of Act, 1954 shall not have any affect on the conviction made in the case in hand under the Act, 1954."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "675e09b641d543e39956baa05ee94faa_28",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "PRE_RELIED"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "However, the Hon'ble Apex Court in Trilok Chand -Vs- State of Himachal Pradesh reported in 2020 10 SCC 763 referring to the earlier judgment of the Hon'ble Apex Court in T. Barai -Vs- Henry Ah Hoe reported in (1983) 1 SCC 177,\nmore particul"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "8c1d997837564d7a96794237241e883b_29",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\nPage No.# 5/6 12."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "2627c2ac083f4f3999eb69e667667a80_31",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "STA"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "13. Section 52 of the Act, 2006 prescribes that any person who, whether by himself or by any other person on his behalf manufactures for sale or stores or sells or distributes or imports any article of food for human consumption which is su"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "ec4015293dc64b0f9100b9d6a7069a0b_32",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "In the case in hand, the complaint and the conviction is also relatable to an allegation which says that the material/food seized from the possession of the accused petitioners were not fit for human consumption."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "2a3333df236746708d2b01f232082819_33",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Therefore, learned counsel, in the considered opinion of this Court, is correct in arguing that such conviction is relatable to Section 51 of the Act, 2006."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "12b1b4f1bc124689b768ebecadef91bb_34",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The other complaint is regarding misbranding inasmuch as, in the complaint, on the basis of expert opinion, it was alleged that the foods were misbranded."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "cb8a6ebafddb4cecbc26a423a26010a7_35",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Therefore, it can be relatable to Section 52 of the Act,\n2006 which prescribes that any person who whether by himself or by any other person on his behalf manufactures for sale or stores or sells or distributes or imports any article of foo"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "7ebf99e04a1b47f18b104c49b58e335f_36",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "14. Therefore, in the given context of the present case, this Court is of the view that the determination made in Trilok Chand (supra) Page No.# 6/6 and M/s A.K.Sarkar (supra) can be made applicable."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "7f2ca839fef841faa3ee08c6eb53bbf0_37",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "15. Accordingly, the present criminal revision petition stands allowed by interfering with the sentence of Rigorous Imprisonment for 6 (six) months each and it is directed that the sentence be confined to the fine already directed to be pai"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "a7c7b44124c341168db6e0c8ebf6eb09_38",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Accordingly, the fine be realized."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "5f19e0c019ea40869ed69f1af27e1f75_42",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Accordingly registry shall ensure that Mrs.\nBhattacharjee, learned counsel be paid the legal fee, as payable to a Legal Aid Counsel as per the norms fixed by the Legal Services Authority.\nJUDGE"
      }
